# Build context for both images (Docker reads this file; Podman falls back to it because there is
# no .containerignore):
#   Dockerfile                        root build: CI checks + runnable service image (D77)
#   deploy/containers/Containerfile   session sandbox image (`session build-image`)
# Both copy explicit paths only. tests/ and data/ (sample parts with reference models) stay in the
# context for the root build's check stage; neither the runtime nor the sandbox image contains them.
.git
.venv
# keys: at any depth (Vite would inline VITE_* values from frontend/.env* into the bundle)
**/.env
**/.env.*
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
docs
.memes
var
out
**/__pycache__
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
frontend/.dev-data
